                            "zh": "欺负我有待改进的机甲有意思吗？"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "I would've obliterated you if I had my refined mech completed!",
                            "zh": "但凡我造好了改进版机甲，我肯定能暴打你的！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Just you wait! It's a work in progress, but not for long!",
                            "zh": "给我等着！虽然现在还没造好，但是迟早会的！"
                        }
